=2 Walkthrough
* Start the Quest by checking the door to {n:Svenja's Manor|Door: Svenja's Manor} in {z:Western Adoulin} (I-8) (Platea Triumphus Waypoint).
* Talk to {n:Eppel-Treppel} in {z:Eastern Adoulin} (G-10) to enter {z:Celennia Memorial Library} for a cutscene.
* Harvest a {@k}{k:Hennebloom leaf} from harvest points in {z:Foret de Hennetiel} with a {i:sickle|Sickle|1020}.
** Fill up your inventory in order to avoid losing the Harvesting Point to items harvested.
** Normal sickles and trailblazing sickles both work.
* Report back to {n:Svenja's Manor|Door: Svenja's Manor} in {z:Western Adoulin} (I-8) for your reward.

=2 Bugs
* It is possible that if you have completed the quest Flowers for Svenja, NPC Grevan won't mention anything about the library ({p:Bug reported|http://forum.square-enix.com/ffxi/threads/35626-Quest-Order-Up-Glitched} 7/12/13), thus preventing you from completing the quest {q:Order Up|Order Up|Order Up}.
** As of January 2019, the said bug has been fixed. It is now possible to complete Flowers for Svenja before either starting or completing {q:Order Up|Order Up|Order Up}.

